WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.250
What if the Sun disappeared, right now?

2
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:09.425
For about eight minutes, nothing would change. Its last light, and even its pull, are still on their way.

3
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.821
Then, darkness. Only our own lamps still shine.

4
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:20.450
The Moon and the planets go dark too. They only reflect sunlight.

5
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:26.156
Within about a week, the average temperature could fall below minus eighteen degrees Celsius.

6
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:32.761
The seas would freeze over on top, but deep down, the oceans could stay liquid for a very long time.

7
00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:37.275
And with nothing to circle, Earth would drift away in a straight line.

8
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:42.329
So that sunshine on your face? It left the Sun eight minutes ago.
